<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38734" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπερώτ-ημα</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπειρ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>question,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.67
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.53
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				68
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Sent.Vat.</u>
				71
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>answer to inquiry</i> put to higher authority: hence,
				<i>sanction,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὸ ἐ. τῶν Ἀρεοπαγιτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					856.6
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1008.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			= Lat. <i>stipulatio, PCair. Preis.</i><i><span class="en">
				1.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cod.Just.</u>
				8.10.12.3
			</span></i> (pl.): hence prob., <i>pledge,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνειδήσεως ἀγαθῆς ἐ. εἰς θεόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>1 Ep.Pet.</u>
					3.21
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
